        },
        {
         "name": {
          "orig": "Shady Shorsh",
          "transl": "Langfinger Louis"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "rookie-harbor.thief-man-small-brown",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Hi!",
          "transl": "Привіт!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "WHISTLING"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "I... I am so sorry.\\. For real this time.",
          "transl": "Tu... Tut mir echt leid!\\. Diesmal wirklich."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "rookie-harbor.thief-man-small-brown",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DETERMINED"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "I'm serious!\\. I'm out of smokebombs anyway, otherwise those damn \\v[combat.name.hedgehog]s never would've gotten me.",
          "transl": "Ich mein's ernst!\\. Ich hab eh keine Rauchbomben mehr, ansonsten hätten mich diese Igöll nie gekriegt."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "rookie-harbor.thief-man-small-brown",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "ANNOYED"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "But maybe they've been sent by the Track to show me the error of my ways.",
          "transl": "Vielleicht war das ein Zeichen von oben, um mir zu zeigen, dass ich vom rechten Weg abgekommen bin."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "rookie-harbor.thief-man-small-brown",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "This time I will turn myself in and atone for my crimes. Truly.",
          "transl": "Deshalb werd' ich mich selbst stellen und für meine Schandtaten geradestehen. Ungelogen."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "rookie-harbor.thief-man-small-brown",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "...",
          "transl": "..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DETERMINED"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "So... if you will excuse me.",
          "transl": "Also... wenn du mich nun entschuldigen würdest..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "rookie-harbor.thief-man-small-brown",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        {
         "name": {
          "orig": "Shady Shorsh",
          "transl": "Langfinger Louis"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "rookie-harbor.thief-man-small-brown",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "name": {
          "orig": "Guard Kima",
          "transl": "Wache Kima"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "rookie-harbor.faction-rhg-female-black",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        null,
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "You're coming with me.",
          "transl": "So, Freundchen! Hab ich dich endlich!"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "rookie-harbor.faction-rhg-female-black",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "B... but I was going to come to you anyway.\\. Don't you trust me?",
          "transl": "A... Aber ich wollte gerade so oder so zu dir kommen.\\. Traust du mir etwa nicht?"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "rookie-harbor.thief-man-small-brown",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Sorry, pal.\\. Trust is nice and all but I won't take any more risks with you.",
          "transl": "Tut mir leid, Kumpel.\\. Vertrauen ist gut, Kontrolle ist besser. Keine Faxen mehr."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "rookie-harbor.faction-rhg-female-black",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Alright, alright.\\. Jeez.",
          "transl": "Also gut, also gut.\\. Jesses..."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "rookie-harbor.thief-man-small-brown",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        null,
        null,
        null,
        null,
        {
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "In any case, thanks, girl.\\. You did great work here.\\. Report back to the chief to get your reward.",
          "transl": "Vielen Dank, junge Dame.\\. Du hast hier gute Arbeit geleistet.\\. Melde dich beim Hauptmann zurück, um deine Belohnung zu erhalten."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "rookie-harbor.faction-rhg-female-black",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        },
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "[nods]",
          "transl": "[киває]"
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "main.lea",
          "expression": "NOD"
         }
        },
        null,
        {
         "message": {
          "orig": "Alright, off we go.",
          "transl": "Gut, gehen wir."
         },
         "person": {
          "person": "rookie-harbor.faction-rhg-female-black",
          "expression": "DEFAULT"
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    ]
